@startuml
' UML Component 03a2 — Domain-event consumers
' Evidence status: Implemented in-process and durable event reactions.
' Updated: 2026-07-29.

!pragma layout elk
left to right direction

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam PageMargin 10
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F0FDF4
  BorderColor #16A34A
  FontColor #14532D
}

component "Versioned event seam" as Events #FEF3C7
component "Notifications\nuser delivery records" as Notifications
component "Audit\ncanonical accountability records" as Audit
component "Search\nprojection updates" as Search
component "Cache\ninvalidation" as Cache

Events --> Notifications : listener → local use case
Events --> Audit : listener → local use case
Events --> Search : listener → local use case
Events --> Cache : listener → local use case

note bottom of Audit
No User Activity runtime consumer.
The former table is a read-only archive.
end note

@enduml
